parameters.text:
=Here’s the data you’ll need:

Business Name: {{ $json.message.content['Business Name'] }}
Access Link: {{ $json.message.content['Access Link'] }}
Revenue: {{ $json.message.content.Revenue }}
EBITDA: {{ $json.message.content.EBITDA }}

Instructions for this one record:
- Call read_info_2 ONLY if Revenue OR EBITDA is missing/unclear.
- If read_info_2 fails (403/captcha/login), rely on the provided inputs. Do NOT pick "Unsure" solely due to a link error.
- Revenue synonyms: Revenue, Sales, ARR, Annual Recurring Revenue, explicit MRR (then Revenue = MRR * 12).
- EBITDA synonyms: EBITDA, Adjusted EBITDA, Adj EBITDA.
- NOT EBITDA: Net Income/Profit, Operating Income/Profit, Gross Profit, Cash Flow, SDE (leave EBITDA = null if only these are present).
- Focus on THIS business only even if the page lists multiple companies.

Return exactly one JSON object per the System Message’s OUTPUT spec.

